# No endpoint defaults ship with this fork. To run against a real backend, set
# ZCODE_BASE_URL (and the other origin vars) in the untracked .env or .env.local,
# or export them in your shell. Left unset, every resolve* helper returns an empty
# string and the feature that needed it fails at the point of use with a message
# naming the variable, rather than reaching a host you did not choose.
